about infants being given sex education or

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.420
whatever.

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:42.910
I looked for a while and I found, No, I don't.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.960
I didn't even find any allegations that it
was happening.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.970
Now, had I found allegations, I would have
tried to find proof.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:52.920
I haven't even found allegations that kids
younger than kindergarten are being taught

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.890
this type of material.

00:02:55.890 --> 00:03:00.620
And it's just there's just no evidence that
it's going on.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:04.360
So Jen Psaki is smart here.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:12.830
